Note: game listens on window keydown ✓ dispatching on window works. keys.add checks e.code ✓ Synthetic KeyboardEvent has code if specified ✓ preventDefault harmless.

Test scenarios in one run? Multiphase title writes with t markers:
- t=2s: record DEMO state (AP true)
- t=3s: dispatch ArrowUp keydown → AP should flip false
- t=5s: record (AP false, everPlayed → title hidden)
