Simpler: build history string `hist += (state,ap,score,asteroids,lives) at each sample`, then set document.title = history (could be long; cap last 800 chars). dump-dom gives <title> element content ✓.

AudioContext creation is in ensureAudio on keydown — dispatching synthetic keydown calls ensureAudio → creates AudioContext in headless (should succeed silently). Fine.

Edge: synthetic KeyboardEvent isTrusted false — game doesn't check trusted ✓.

